        "change_commit": "f41d6db846097d9e26fe02005affc81007b42c5c",
        "reason": "The accepted coin-pusher prize-item feature added authored non-contraband item identity and icon metadata to special weighted riders and their settled bodies; no Crew state or Crew behavior changed.",
        "proof": "The prior accepted capture and the current capture were recursively compared for both fixed seeds at all five checkpoints. Every value change was confined to Coin Pusher rider or settled-body item_id, item_label, item_asset_path, item_icon_key, and pusher_item_assigned fields plus their enclosing byte counts and hashes; zero changed paths contained Crew state. Same-seed twins, inactive world-sequence/Crew no-ops, and zero Crew trust remain mandatory."
